{"4928730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hold the Line", "steam_appid": 4928730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4946760], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the Line is a top-down 2D pixel-art roguelite island survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Seven Days on a Procedurally Generated Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/4706b1d9888c830183845fd3f532849d.poster.avif?t=1786864089\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/4706b1d9888c830183845fd3f532849d.webm?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/4706b1d9888c830183845fd3f532849d.mp4?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each run begins on a procedurally generated island where you must fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and build up your base during the day, grow stronger through research, and fend off hostile wildlife at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to an ever-changing environment, grow stronger, and face the run’s final challenge on Day 7.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt to Unexpected Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c12be8783968faf6b108df301deb0457.poster.avif?t=1786864089\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c12be8783968faf6b108df301deb0457.webm?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c12be8783968faf6b108df301deb0457.mp4?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected events can occur throughout each run, changing the environment and animal behavior while creating new survival challenges and new ways to find resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on changes in your surroundings before events occur, gather resources ahead of time, adjust your strategy, and prepare for what's coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a variety of events, emerge stronger from each one, and take on increasingly difficult events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own way to survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c76b14942be2b6b435a5e5fece2cd8ad.poster.avif?t=1786864089\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c76b14942be2b6b435a5e5fece2cd8ad.webm?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c76b14942be2b6b435a5e5fece2cd8ad.mp4?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new traits as you progress through each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new traits as you progress through each run, shaping your survival style in unique ways. These traits can alter your attributes, enhance your actions, unlock new building functions, and change your relationship with wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right traits, combine their effects, and gradually shape your own survival style.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the Line is a top-down 2D pixel-art roguelite island survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Seven Days on a Procedurally Generated Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/4706b1d9888c830183845fd3f532849d.poster.avif?t=1786864089\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/4706b1d9888c830183845fd3f532849d.webm?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/4706b1d9888c830183845fd3f532849d.mp4?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each run begins on a procedurally generated island where you must fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and build up your base during the day, grow stronger through research, and fend off hostile wildlife at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to an ever-changing environment, grow stronger, and face the run’s final challenge on Day 7.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt to Unexpected Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c12be8783968faf6b108df301deb0457.poster.avif?t=1786864089\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c12be8783968faf6b108df301deb0457.webm?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c12be8783968faf6b108df301deb0457.mp4?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected events can occur throughout each run, changing the environment and animal behavior while creating new survival challenges and new ways to find resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on changes in your surroundings before events occur, gather resources ahead of time, adjust your strategy, and prepare for what's coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a variety of events, emerge stronger from each one, and take on increasingly difficult events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own way to survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c76b14942be2b6b435a5e5fece2cd8ad.poster.avif?t=1786864089\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c76b14942be2b6b435a5e5fece2cd8ad.webm?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928730/extras/c76b14942be2b6b435a5e5fece2cd8ad.mp4?t=1786864089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new traits as you progress through each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new traits as you progress through each run, shaping your survival style in unique ways. These traits can alter your attributes, enhance your actions, unlock new building functions, and change your relationship with wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right traits, combine their effects, and gradually shape your own survival style.</p>", "short_description": "Hold the Line is a top-down 2D roguelite survival game. Survive on a procedurally generated island, prepare by day, endure the night, forge your survival build, adapt to dynamic events, and face the final trial on Day 7.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_